  warSceneName: Practice
  loadDedicatedPracticeScenes: 1
  controlsCopy: 'W / S - forward and reverse

    A / D - steer tracks

    Shift
    - low gear crawl

    Hold W 3s - RPM overdrive boost

    Mouse X - turret yaw

    Q
    / E - barrel pitch

    Mouse wheel - fine elevation

    + / - - cannon power

    Right
    click - scope

    Left click / Space - fire

    F - machine gun'
  drivingPracticeCopy: 'DRIVING PRACTICE

    Huge obstacle lap with whoops, jumps,
    bridge, and hill-climb physics. Hold W to build RPM and unleash overdrive smoke
    boost.'
  cannonPracticeCopy: 'CANNON PRACTICE

    Long-range targets from 120m to 520m.
    Right-click scope for sniper shots.'
  warCopy: 'WAR

    Spawn enemy tanks and defend the castle.'
